+    "\n",
+    "\n",
+    "**Notation aligned with the paper (Eqs. 3–7).** The index $n$ denotes an input/observation and $k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,K\\}$ denotes a class ($K=4$ here). The class indicator $y_{n,k}$ is 1 when the observed class is $k$ and 0 otherwise. The network produces nonnegative evidence $e_{n,k}$, giving\n",
+    "\\[\n",
+    "\\alpha_{n,k}=e_{n,k}+1,\\qquad\n",
+    "S_n=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\alpha_{n,k},\\qquad\n",
+    "\\boldsymbol p_n\\sim\\operatorname{Dir}(\\boldsymbol\\alpha_n).\n",
+    "\\]\n",
+    "Here $\\boldsymbol p_n$ is the **latent probability vector**. The predicted probability is its mean (Eq. 4):\n",
+    "\\[\n",
