+    "| `evidential`, `df[\"evidential\"]` | DST uncertainty mass $u_n=K/S_n$, Eq. (6) |\n",
+    "| `ev_s` | $S_n$ (here $K=4$) |\n",
+    "| Per-class `aleatoric` | $\\mathbb{E}[\\operatorname{Var}(y_{n,k}\\mid p_{n,k})]$, Eqs. (20)–(21) |\n",
