+    "\n",
+    "    ``attributions`` is [batch][output], with each tensor shaped\n",
+    "    (observations, features, ...). Supply one timestamp per observation in\n",
+    "    the exact concatenated loader order. Use an unshuffled loader and its\n",
+    "    aligned metadata, or collect timestamps with each batch; dataset order\n",
+    "    cannot be assumed for a shuffled loader. Batch numbers are not time.\n",
